<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Doctor Application Rejected</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f7fa; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #f5f7fa; padding: 40px 15px;">

        <tr>
            <td align="center">

                <!-- Email Container -->
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                    style="max-width: 500px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">

                    <!-- Header -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 28px 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;">
                            <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #111827; font-size: 22px;">
                                Doctor Application Update
                            </h2>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Content -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 30px;">

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                            ">
                                Hello <strong>
                                    <%= name %>
                                </strong>,
                            </p>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                            ">
                                Thank you for your interest in joining our healthcare
                                platform and for taking the time to submit your doctor
                                application.
                            </p>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                            ">
                                After carefully reviewing your application and the
                                information provided, we regret to inform you that
                                your doctor application has been <strong>rejected</strong>
                                at this time.
                            </p>

                            <!-- Application Status -->
                            <div style="
                                margin: 25px 0;
                                padding: 20px;
                                background-color: #f3f4f6;
                                border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                                border-radius: 6px;
                            ">

                                <p style="
                                    margin: 0 0 15px;
                                    color: #111827;
                                    font-size: 18px;
                                    font-weight: bold;
                                    text-align: center;
                                ">
                                    Application Rejected
                                </p>

                                <p style="
                                    margin: 0 0 8px;
                                    color: #6b7280;
                                    font-size: 13px;
                                ">
                                    <strong style="color: #374151;">
                                        Reason for Rejection:
                                    </strong>
                                </p>

                                <p style="
                                    margin: 0;
                                    padding: 12px;
                                    background-color: #ffffff;
                                    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                                    border-radius: 4px;
                                    color: #374151;
                                    font-size: 14px;
                                    line-height: 1.6;
                                ">
                                    <%= rejectionReason %>
                                </p>
                                <p style="
                                    margin: 0 0 8px;
                                    color: #6b7280;
                                    font-size: 13px;
                                ">
                                    <strong style="color: #374151;">
                                        Rejected Date:
                                    </strong>
                                </p>

                                <p style="
                                    margin: 0;
                                    padding: 12px;
                                    background-color: #ffffff;
                                    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
                                    border-radius: 4px;
                                    color: #374151;
                                    font-size: 14px;
                                    line-height: 1.6;
                                ">
                                    <%= rejectedDate %>

                                </p>

                            </div>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0 0 15px;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 15px;
                                line-height: 1.6;
                            ">
                                We encourage you to review the reason provided above
                                and take any necessary steps to address the issue.
                            </p>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 0;
                                color: #6b7280;
                                font-size: 13px;
                                line-height: 1.5;
                            ">
                                If you believe this decision was made in error or you
                                have questions regarding your application, please
                                contact our support team for further assistance.
                            </p>

                            <p style="
                                margin: 25px 0 0;
                                color: #374151;
                                font-size: 14px;
                                line-height: 1.5;
                            ">
                                Thank you for your understanding and for your interest
                                in our healthcare platform.
                            </p>

                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="
                            padding: 20px 30px;
                            background-color: #fafafa;
                            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
                            text-align: center;
                        ">
                            <p style="
                                margin: 0;
                                color: #9ca3af;
                                font-size: 12px;
                            ">
                                This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </table>

            </td>
        </tr>

    </table>

</body>

</html>